T*
(Many real-world engineering models \(e.g. non-linear diode equations, transient) Tj
T*
(differential equations\) lack analytical closed-form solutions and mandate computational) Tj
T*
(algorithms:) Tj
T*
(* 1. Non-Linear Root Finding \(Newton-Raphson Method\):) Tj
T*
(- Iterative formulation: x_{n+1} = x_n - f\(x_n\) / f'\(x_n\). Quadratic rate of convergence) Tj
T*
(near roots.) Tj
T*
(* 2. Numerical Integration:) Tj
T*
(- Trapezoidal Rule: Integral_a^b [ f\(x\) dx ] approx \(h / 2\) * [ f\(a\) + 2 * sum\(f\(x_i\)\) +) Tj
T*
(f\(b\) ].) Tj
T*
(- Simpson's 1/3 Rule: Fits parabolic quadratic polynomials through sets of 3 points:) Tj
T*
(Integral_a^b [ f\(x\) dx ] approx \(h / 3\) * [ f\(x_0\) + 4 * sum\(odd\) + 2 * sum\(even\) +) Tj
T*
(f\(x_n\) ]. Higher accuracy order O\(h^4\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
