T*
(* First-Order Low-Pass RC Filter: H\(j*omega\) = 1 / \(1 + j * omega * R * C\). Magnitude) Tj
T*
(|H\(j*omega\)| = 1 / sqrt\(1 + \(omega / omega_c\)^2\).) Tj
T*
(* Bode Plot Representation: Decibel magnitude response: Gain \(dB\) = 20 *) Tj
T*
(log10\(|H\(j*omega\)|\). Cutoff frequency f_c = 1 / \(2 * pi * R * C\) corresponds to -3.01) Tj
T*
(dB attenuation.) Tj
