([PROGRAM 3: Fast Fourier Transform \(FFT\) Spectral Analysis Simulator]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Synthesize a dual-tone audio signal \(500 Hz + 1200 Hz\) corrupted by) Tj
T*
(random Gaussian noise, and extract dominant harmonic peaks using NumPy FFT.) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(import numpy as np) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Sampling parameters) Tj
T*
(f_s = 8000.0 # 8 kHz audio sampling rate) Tj
T*
(n_samples = 2048 # FFT length \(power of 2\)) Tj
T*
(t = np.arange\(n_samples\) / f_s) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
